{"sectionId":"bonding/mo","items":[{"id":"bonding--mo-k001","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"원자 오비탈의 선형결합은 에너지가 낮은 결합성 MO와 높은 반결합성 MO를 형성할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k002","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"전자는 Pauli·Hund 규칙에 따라 채워진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k003","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"결합차수=(결합성 전자수−반결합성 전자수)/2이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k004","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"N₂는 대표적 결합차수 3의 반자성 분자이며 O₂는 결합차수 2와 두 홀전자를 갖는 상자성 분자다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k005","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"O₂⁺는 반결합성 전자 제거로 결합차수 2.5, O₂⁻는 1.5가 된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k006","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"B₂,C₂,N₂ 등에서는 2p π 결합성 MO가 σ2p보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k007","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"낮은 순서를 흔히 사용하고 O₂,F₂에서는 반대 순서를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k008","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"이종핵 이원자분자에서 원자 오비탈 에너지가 달라 MO 기여가 비대칭적일 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k009","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"결합차수가 커질수록 비슷한 분자 사이에서는 대체로 결합 길이가 짧아지고 강도가 증가한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k010","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"HOMO는 최고 점유, LUMO는 최저 비점유 분자궤도이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k011","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"O₂ 상자성은 단순 Lewis 구조만으로 설명하기 어렵다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k012","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"결합차수 0은 단순 MO 모형에서 안정 결합이 불리함을 시사한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k013","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"반결합성 MO에 전자를 추가하면 결합차수가 감소한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"bonding--mo-k014","sectionId":"bonding/mo","unitId":"bonding","subject":"chemistry","text":"1이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}